    <section xml:id="sec-section-1-11">
      <title>Section 11 - Equations for a Plane</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Write the equation of a plane given points or lines.</li>
    <li>Find the distance between a plane and a point.</li>
    <li>Find the line of intersection for two planes.</li>
    <li>Find the angle between two planes.</li>
    <li>Find the distance between two parallel planes.</li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

